musl has no `struct ucontext`, only `ucontext_t` (`typedef struct ucontext_t
{ ... } ucontext_t;`, as glibc since 2.26). Building libgcc's unwind-dw2.c
on Tilck (19-gcc464 README, "Patches"):

  config/riscv/linux-unwind.h:45:21: error: field 'uc' has incomplete type

The same substitution Ekaitz's commencement.scm makes for gcc-muslboot0
(phase patch-for-modern-libc: "struct ucontext" -> "ucontext_t").

--- a/gcc/config/riscv/linux-unwind.h
+++ b/gcc/config/riscv/linux-unwind.h
@@ -42,7 +42,7 @@
   struct rt_sigframe
   {
     siginfo_t info;
-    struct ucontext uc;
+    ucontext_t uc;
   };
 
   struct rt_sigframe *rt_;
